135:<section id="about" class="part">
136:<h2>What this page is</h2>
137:<p>The <code>fortress-repo</code> skill holds the rules that bind every worker in the repository. This page shows you each change that landed in it, as a diff with its reason, so that you can check what the workers are now told whenever you want. To reverse a change, send a comment to Claude on its item, or say so in chat.</p>
138:</section>
140:<section id="s1" class="part">
141:<h2>Landed since your last read</h2>
142:<p>Twelve items. Climb batch 25 landed on <code>main</code> at 03:49 UTC on 3 November, in commit <code>11d2d8764</code>. The landing made sentences of the skill's area parts false, so the coordinator gave the skill writer nine changes to make: seven in the area parts, a lower cap on an agent's wait, and a narrower rule on who reads the revival part. The writer made them at 05:52 UTC, in commits <code>597537f2e</code> and <code>59cc13881</code>. A cold read of the two commits found passages that a worker could misread, and at 06:01 the writer's commit <code>f11ad4602</code> fixed them. No 
143:<p>Each item shows the text on <code>main</code> now, against the text before <code>597537f2e</code>. The words that changed are underlined, and the words that went are struck through. Where the fixes changed the first commits' words again, the item shows the net change, and its reason says what the cold read changed.</p>
