178:<p>It refuses a function or method with a modifier other than <code>getter</code>, <code>setter</code>, <code>io</code>, <span class="cut"><code>private</code></span> <span class="add"><code>private</code>, <code>abstract</code></span> and <span class="cut"><code>abstract</code>,</span> <span class="add"><code>test</code>,</span> such as <code>override</code> (ledger row 650).</p>
