189:<div class="note"><p><strong>Why.</strong> The part did not say that such a declaration compiles at <code>Any</code>, as it does since climb batch 25. The text now says so, and tells the refusal at <code>Bottom</code>, <code>Self</code> or an abbreviated type, which a worker records as an <code>XXX</code> test, from the crash at a tuple, with the abbreviated type defined from the specification's array type [F-315, F-268, row 889].</p></div>
